caption: Field Operator Ranks

Congratulations on signing up as a Starbucks Field Operation Specialist! Everyone starts at the bottom, but here at Starbucks the stars aren’t even a limit! Starbucks Field Operation Specialists are ranked, all the way from G, where you now are, up to Triple-S. The ranks are just a guide, though. While they do determine what kinds of jobs you can take, they aren’t a judgement on you as a person. Think of them sort of like belts in martial arts: they designate progress and skill, not dedication or spunk!
